m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/BWcLSaYPNM2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/CntZPnG4DQ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/BvtjzVprsi2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/pqkRGeXJXH2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 65584, "title": "为女人花钱，我成为了亿万富家", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/34f5ff5ece2fd6047257380109c508c0.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/Sq6BTGmHSK2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/XNPpjxLMwS2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/N9d8aPs60j2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/4w0rYDarMb2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/03/4WdwJJUy9y2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 65362, "title": "都市极品代驾", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/c484d5eec7b8ae1c687fe4cf671f3cf9.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>都市极品代驾张瑞，居然假借客户的豪车来泡妞，引得天怒人冤！不过张瑞此次下山，是为了完成爷爷早年定下的婚约，与纪家小姐纪嫣结婚，平平无奇的代驾小子，竟然成了纪家的乘龙快婿</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/06/ygkVhdmkNx2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/06/DuKcsJWw0x2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/06/zhLqLwaiyp2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/06/X6sd7k0zLn2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 65209, "title": "妈妈再爱我一次", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/16e1ff410f265b426f3d18537e27ba14.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>女人在直播中竟发现自己女儿竟在遭受非人的折磨，等她赶來之時，却发现女儿已是伤痕累累！ 为了不让女儿再受伤害，女人決定重出江湖！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/08/6PEAjn1jbu2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/08/FRrZX5nEHz2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/08/AJg6V7G79b2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/08/PpgeBmqMhe2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 65081, "title": "妻子的审判", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/2f01119043b78e55187b658cb8830536.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>女人从一个孤儿逆袭成为首富夫人，不料首富丈夫却在一夜之间离奇死亡，人人都以为是女人动的手，直到审判长將真相放出，才发现她才是真正的受害者</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-10集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/m8hSwLvcx52/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "11-25集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/J1B8X0QwYa2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "26-39集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/A2n9kjxpqv2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "40-58集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/2R9tkLTLpU2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "59-79集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/qqgPyF21au2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 65058, "title": "全能女王飒翻天", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/d99425ebc6cf784558cebcb9587e9f21.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>云生被误认为是医学院的学生,实际上她只是一名普通女孩。为了破解身份之谜,她开始学习医术。与此同时,她的婚姻也面临危机。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/uYKNuP1NNk2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/swBkP1KaWd2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/J3he8pWB6U2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/Ycnf9zqXiP2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/vWxEL9awz72/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "101-120集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/StiYiaBp6E2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 64973, "title": "圣徒", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/601241d849f0c437055d03726f476053.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>杨过和徐家联姻引发了家族纷争，而杨过的孤独和毒害问题也浮出水面。与此同时，徐家老人的病情危急，医生争分夺秒救治，却引发了医疗纠纷</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/aM0he752942/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/SwcBuqJ4iy2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": " 41-60集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/FHL1aqLzZy2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/39ytJBWJxq2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/iz5Dd1tmcw2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "101-120集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/12/J8bpn16XBQ2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 64881, "title": "等你回家", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/2abb91d8a875f6391f10a2a4708cfb9d.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>爷爷重病，奶奶迷信妖人要献祭亲孙女，妈妈偷偷送出女儿，女孩被好心的婆婆收养长大成人，然而一天她被妹妹陷害又被亲生母亲送进监狱五年..&nbsp;</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/18hRPSjVQM2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/Di89Aghq8K2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/9p8CFTdxQQ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/hd9FUXr5xB2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/upwVPnLYb12/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 64816, "title": "朝九晚五小保安", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/fc55326d75148fd7aa37530cb4b12c6c.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/16/8bsvVzhUv22/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/16/M2eK3a8Bc22/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/16/eJ15ue6MuF2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/16/pMq9BzXLSD2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/16/t5gyZUX73f2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 64629, "title": "如果爱忘了", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/65251d9015eb3b1d3040923858331ec7.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>女孩看見自己小時候的照片出現在首富家中，才明白自己竟是首富的孩子！ 然而女孩卻將能相認的照片親手毀掉，只因她恨透了當年的母親！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/X941TfS4Gg2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/dejsKeaSCC2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/puRM5EpWeb2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/ybPy69Eehk2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/Nde05xqnb52/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 64560, "title": "一闪一闪姜星星", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/c469714ff53684bac62f3e90ecb87650.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>她是被替换的千金，在谎言中生活了二十年</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/RWCYfNxR2p2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/wpAwTFGdgb2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/PAaRALskfT2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/ReMpsiUzVf2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 64558, "title": "燃冬之女王加冕", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/17d4d68a794fbe6668835904f1d11e32.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>男孩替霸总大哥去相亲，殊不知竟爱上了相亲对象，爱而不得的他只能将爱放在心底，殊不知，女人早已爱上了眼前的男人，并准备私奔</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/Crxrux7wag2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/RGqiaDDT5p2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/MjEpHCy6u72/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/KqamNPTxn22/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 64077, "title": "女王的职业装", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/646071b549e5673e2d738d3f2494992f.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>女子短暂失忆后，竟然被丈夫当场包，身边的男人到底是谁。当质问闺蜜时，发现这一切并不简单</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/25/2WaX1ha9q02/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/25/QWvBa3Y3VG2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/25/vcFaEHeykW2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/25/dv98wrHYgx2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-93集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/25/KzEDxkhzYB2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63992, "title": "世上只有妈妈好", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/e19991d4ab9cc3678b9fd7f6c85c30c6.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>女孩怎么也想不到自己的妈妈竟偏袒别人？ 直到此时，女总裁才发现自己一直毫无心意的养女，竟是自己寻找多年，苦苦求来的亲生女儿！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/vrSF4cHGuJ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/2bachvUSFA2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/wLspMARhsb2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/9Nx2ajEqCN2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/4FSKd3dtRn2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63989, "title": "炽热的爱", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/ec211c1961b1fda554f6d6a880c88d05.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>白晓青一直生活在姜家，与母亲陆南燕相依为命。但陆南燕发现白晓青的身世证明似乎有问题，开始质疑她的真实身份。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/mJMazz6LgQ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/cpJZxAuTC12/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/bA9J4aXr4k2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/dqpUFpb4pS2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63833, "title": "盲眼千金爱上我", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/9d29f3dfd441b053dd7bff52ed1f7092.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/is9eqdVw7t2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/5VnXKcpchd2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/M6s8yDzDUh2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63832, "title": "我的美女总裁老婆", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/9653362ae4948fcf678696c489210c17.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/4Q0avmgceN2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/bMYUMcCgrR2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/an01Amwb242/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/ME21PW7JiU2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63831, "title": "天降舅舅，亿万总裁放肆宠", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/55290e375eebb19265b27986b91a66b6.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>姜家玉佩的出现引发了一系列事件，包括江家寻找失散女儿、争夺身份、反腐等打击，最终揭露了姜悦洛的真实身份。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/2a4d54NvAj2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/qjUMbYqDZY2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/Ddka5YbtPU2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/30/sssLjzjxUi2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63450, "title": "第二神王", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/6961c16ab41015ded4d3ee1c8fc3f383.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>神王在班师回朝时遭遇失踪，而我应长得像神王就被他的部下盯上了！虽然为了我女儿的救命钱，但居然要我假扮神王！原来我是神王胞弟，这壹切都是为了引出幕后黑手</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/VmeThbKWm22/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/hq8Begp18g2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/ZqGdEmtLrr2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/RQMLyenYPS2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/7mtQq1t7W12/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63449, "title": "谁是我的新娘", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/4473d9eed8d45cc4335d87b81efdf5d3.png", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>王浩然意外和五个女孩成了室友。和哪一个睡觉成为一个棘手的问题。作为一个绅士，我最好和他们五个人一起睡。韦小宝式搞笑爱情故事</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/eFJjg8TU8S2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/fuNu1WZ07A2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/URpq6JFswj2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/03/GCsKYtRC3J2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 63377, "title": "又是一年除夕夜", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/43a50df087660aa91ad6d777cd3b3980.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>爱与牺牲，除夕诞生的命运：《又是一年除夕》</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/NyJ6bxVGeR2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/sUv4bmgcn22/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/S6id7vGReR2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/C7YY4ggqh42/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 58959, "title": "许你余生暖又甜", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231225-1/559b39c1fda12375e9713b4434aa01bb.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202404/17/0JqXdgxYvY80/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 58843, "title": "出道七年当明星", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231223-1/b5abf65db224f49c18a9ec1e63169946.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202404/17/D9ntZeQqza81/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 58729, "title": "今日宜欢", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231220-1/7ca7316cd84b81e8796eb5c62f89bbc7.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202404/14/Ea0aaumrJE82/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 58574, "title": "我的白眼狼女儿", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231217-1/4ae1e3c9538d671398d9b2209878a76e.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/13/gQT04UrNAn83/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 58531, "title": "迟欢似是顾人来", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231216-1/71a6ce7a0d7521d28604b26b28e95626.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/13/5s60A75Rxb83/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 58442, "title": "美女总裁欠我赊刀债", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231215-1/7f49885423a2ed184395b264fc1be8ae.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202404/16/PUAXp4iAjK81/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_35cbbe42a2_part118.json"}, {"id": 52410, "title": "全资进组", "category": "现代都市", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260405-1/2db5353d57ce64d131e37eeb6cdf91f8.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "陈腾跃,屈梦汝,邓诗韵,蔡卓宜,杨志雯,陈婧旸,罗予彤,邹思扬,梦汐,高维蔓,关博,权沛伦,仟承 ,许焱磊,刘星麓,慕琳哪 ,李丰蔚", "director": "巴晨旭", "content": "<p>《全资进组》讲述了一个天马行空的资方爸爸全资进组，为了完成自己各种古装大男主的梦想疯狂改剧本，导致剧情直线横跳。卑微倔强的编剧无力反抗，顶着越来越秃的头发使出浑身解数拼命填坑，各种反套路火力全开。风格彻底失控，人设反复崩塌。从宅斗到悬疑，从悬疑到仙侠，从仙侠到武林，从武林到宫廷，从宫廷到穿越……打破次元壁，各种国产古装剧类型欢聚一堂，题材开会。在他们的努力下：仙侠剧将首次从地理学大陆板块硬核打开；冰块脸男主的元神真的是一块万年玄冰；勾心斗角的宫廷剧变得异常融洽姐妹情深；锦衣卫办案悬疑感满满找了全剧也没找到凶手；白面书生赶考路上被富家千金风险投资意外称霸武林；精分男狐正邪同体切换女捉妖师难敌魅惑因爱生恨；甚至男主的朋友来探班带的爱犬为了加戏出镜也直接成了精，还给加了感情线……但在所有人都觉得这是一场闹剧的背后，你会发现他是一位演员对梦想歇斯底里的追求和...</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202604/04/fqF1dsAVNi95/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/ALqF6PUuyM1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/3cjHJjtJEJ1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/GRsJ52nUGc1/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": 